# i18n (locked)

Docs: `packages/locale/I18N.md` · keys: `packages/locale/keys.ts`

## Locales (all keys required in every pack)
`zh-CN` · `zh-TW` · `en-US` · `ja-JP` · `ko-KR` · `ko-KP` · `ru-RU`  
Meta: `LOCALE_META` · codes: `LOCALE_CODES`

## Rules
- All user-visible copy via `t(key)` / `LocaleService.t` — buttons, page titles, tips, errors, validation.
- Key shape: `domain.entity.desc` — `button.*` · `page.*` · `tip.*` · `error.*` · `auth.*` · `biz.*` · `nav.*` · `common.*`
- Add key to `LocaleKeys` + **every** locale pack. Missing translation = bug.
- Interpolate: `error.minLength` → `t(key, { min: 6 })`.
- Boot: `LocaleService.init()`; persist `data-locale` + `lang`; URL `?lang=ja-JP`.

## Length (CJK vs Latin/Cyrillic)
- Short CJK vs long EN/RU → UI chrome: grow/wrap (≤2-line clamp), not forced `…`.
- Dynamic data: ellipsis OK with `:title`.
- Styles: `i18n-layout.scss` · `en-US`/`ru-RU` widen chrome · `ja-JP`/`ko-*` mild widen.

## Don’t
Hardcode copy in SFC/SCSS/**example pages** (toasts, placeholders, stub checklists, `title` attrs); ship one locale only; clip labels with fixed width + ellipsis.
See also **`vue3-amg-webui-no-hardcode.mdc`** (copy + token ban, alwaysApply).
